 571:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  Gets the specified parameter value from the \ref group_structures.
 572:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *
 573:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** * \details
 574:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  This function gets the value of the specified parameter by the paramId 
 575:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  argument. The paramId for each register is available in the 
 576:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  CapSense RegisterMap header file as 
 577:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  CapSense_<ParameterName>_PARAM_ID. The paramId is a special 
 578:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  enumerated value generated by the customizer. The format of paramId is as 
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Lenovo\AppData\Local\Temp\ccj7Szb4.s 			page 15


 579:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  follows:
 580:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *    1. [ byte 3 byte 2 byte 1 byte 0 ] 
 581:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *    2. [ TTWFCCCC UIIIIIII MMMMMMMM LLLLLLLL ]
 582:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *    3. T - encodes the parameter type:
 583:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *      - 01b: uint8
 584:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *      - 10b: uint16
 585:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *      - 11b: uint32
 586:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *    4. W - indicates whether the parameter is writable:
 587:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *      - 0: ReadOnly
 588:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *      - 1: Read/Write
 589:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *    5. C - 4 bit CRC (X^3 + 1) of the whole paramId word, the C bits are 
 590:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *       filled with 0s when the CRC is calculated.
 591:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *    6. U - indicates if the parameter affects the RAM Widget Object CRC.
 592:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *    7. I - specifies that the widgetID parameter belongs to
 593:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *    8. M,L - the parameter offset MSB and LSB accordingly in:
 594:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *      - Flash Data Structure if W bit is 0.
 595:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *      - RAM Data Structure if W bit is 1.
 596:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *
 597:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  Refer to the \ref group_structures section for details of the data structure 
