 599:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *
 600:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** * \param  paramId 
 601:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  Specify the ID of parameter to get its value.
 602:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  A macro for the parameter ID can be found in the CapSense RegisterMap header 
