 798:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *
 799:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** * \brief
 800:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  Reports if any widget has detected a touch.
 801:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *
 802:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** * \details
 803:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  This function reports if any widget has detected a touch or not by extracting 
 804:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  the information from the wdgtStatus registers 
 805:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  (CapSense_WDGT_STATUS<X>_VALUE). This function does not process any 
 806:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  widget but extracts the processed results from the \ref group_structures.
 807:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *
 808:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** * \return 
 809:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *   Returns the touch detection status of all widgets:
