1034:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** * \brief
1035:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  Reports the finger detection status of the specified proximity widget/sensor.
1036:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *
1037:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** * \details 
1038:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  This function reports if the specified proximity sensor has detected a touch
1039:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  or not by extracting the information from the wdgtStatus registers 
1040:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  (CapSense_SNS_STATUS<WidgetId>_VALUE). This function should be used 
1041:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  only with the proximity sensor widgets. This function does not process the 
1042:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  widget but extracts the processed results from the \ref group_structures.
1043:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *
1044:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** * \param widgetId  
