1051:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  get its touch detection status.
1052:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  A macro for the proximity ID within a specified widget can be found in the
1053:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  CapSense Configuration header file defined as 
1054:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  CapSense_<WidgetName>_SNS<SensorNumber>_ID
1055:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *
1056:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** * \return 
1057:Generated_Source\PSoC4/CapSense_Structure.c **** *  Returns the status of the specified sensor of proximity widget. Zero 
